<p>Fires a shot that explodes into a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> ball of razor sharp fragments on impact, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage and leaving targets crippled for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns, reducing their attack, spell and mind speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 22%, 28%, 33%, 36%.</acronym></p><p>Each target struck has a 20% chance to be marked.</p><p>The status chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>